,"primary":291,"id":293,"slice_type":147,"slice_label":44},"listComponent",[230,243,255,267,279],{"title":231,"content":232,"icon":236},"Parcel collection from wherever suits you, your home or workplace",[233],{"type":65,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":68},"We have a variety of options of ParcelShops and Lockers across Northampton, as well as courier collection ",[],{"dimensions":237,"alt":239,"copyright":44,"url":240,"id":241,"edit":242},{"width":238,"height":238},40,"Icon of a parcel","courier-services-northampton.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},{"title":244,"content":245,"icon":249},"Parcel cover included",[246],{"type":65,"text":247,"spans":248,"direction":68},"Every parcel includes up to £20 free parcel cover.* You can increase the value up to £999 and choose to add a digital signature for extra peace of mind. *excludes Postable parcels.",[],{"dimensions":250,"alt":251,"copyright":44,"url":252,"id":253,"edit":254},{"width":238,"height":238},"Money icon","courier-services-northampton.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F41d7371a-386e-4d75-a28e-2ea118d1d0af_money.svg","Yh96FxIAAC8A-Zsd",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},{"title":256,"content":257,"icon":261},"Flexible printing options",[258],{"type":65,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":68},"Print your postage labels at home or in-store for FREE using our Print in Store devices",[],{"dimensions":262,"alt":263,"copyright":44,"url":264,"id":265,"edit":266},{"width":238,"height":238},"Printer icon","courier-services-northampton.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Ffdc990f7-2855-4f2e-9ddb-97e26bf3eac3_print+at+home.svg","Yh96GBIAAC0A-Zsk",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},{"title":268,"content":269,"icon":273},"Delivery confirmation with photo",[270],{"type":65,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":68},"Our couriers will take a photo upon delivery, providing proof that your parcel has arrived safely.  ",[],{"dimensions":274,"alt":275,"copyright":44,"url":276,"id":277,"edit":278},{"width":238,"height":238},"Phone icon","courier-services-northampton.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd7cc2443-0047-4998-a550-fabf5e0f598a_phone.svg","Yh96FxIAACwA-Zse",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},{"title":280,"content":281,"icon":285},"Trusted by big brands",[282],{"type":65,"text":283,"spans":284,"direction":68},"We’re trusted by some of the biggest names in retail like Hello Fresh, John Lewis, Next, Marks & Spencer, Shein, Wayfair and more",[],{"dimensions":286,"alt":287,"copyright":44,"url":288,"id":289,"edit":290},{"width":238,"height":238},"Success icon","courier-services-northampton.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8d947c5f-d007-4da4-b0c6-86691eda4240_success.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsm",{"x":58,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},{"theme":144,"title":292,"description":44},"Why choose Evri in Northampton?","list_block$214cb5e7-f6a9-4679-b42a-f2810e1163e8",{"variation":46,"version":25,"items":295,"primary":296,"id":308,"slice_type":309,"slice_label":44},[],{"title":297,"bodyText":298,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":38,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":20,"buttonText":44,"buttonLink":302,"image":303},"Are you VAT registered?",[299],{"type":65,"text":300,"spans":301,"direction":68},"Your business can claim back taxes on any parcels you send across the UK with us - that makes your parcels even cheaper!",[],{"link_type":173},{"dimensions":304,"alt":44,"copyright":44,"url":305,"id":306,"edit":307},{"width":52,"height":126},"courier-services-northampton.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ3wUvJbqstJ99FvA_Smallbusinessowneronlaptop.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=2%2C0%2C7004%2C4672&w=1000&h=667","Z3wUvJbqstJ99FvA",{"x":130,"y":58,"zoom":59,"background":60},"feature_banner$67d0120f-ab67-47f3-b6fb-da1dd7